ObjectPM is a library of objects called a "class library" that
provides the means to develop object-oriented OS/2 applications in
C++. This allows industrial strength applications to be developed in
a fraction of the time required to develop the same applications in
C.  In addition, the benefits of C++ can be realized in smaller, more
reliable and maintainable programs.  Included are some sample programs
with source and the DLL's needed to run them.  The .LIBs are not
supplied so you will not be able to recompile them yourselves.  The
file FILELIST.DOC contains a listing and description of the included
files.

